        "paragraphs": [
            "Xiaomi MiMo is a family of large-scale models from Xiaomi. Xiaomi says the family is a universal smart platform, making advanced AI technology serve everyone and helping to create a future of human-machine collaboration. The models cover language, multimodal, and voice technologies. Xiaomi says the family includes Xiaomi MiMo-V2.6-Series, Xiaomi MiMo-V2.5-TTS Series, Xiaomi MiMo-V2.5-Pro, Xiaomi MiMo-V2.5, Xiaomi MiMo-V2-Pro, Xiaomi MiMo-V2-Omni, Xiaomi MiMo-V2-TTS, Xiaomi MiMo-V2-Flash, Xiaomi MiMo-V2.5-ASR, and MiMo-Audio.",
            "Xiaomi offers the models through a Web Demo, API Access, and MiMo Gallery. Xiaomi also provides MiMo Code and MiMo Desktop as products. The family is documented in papers and blog posts, including MiMo-V2-Flash Technical Report, MiMo-VL Technical Report, and MiMo: Unlocking the Reasoning Potential of Language Model ,  From Pretraining to Posttraining. Xiaomi says MiMo-V2.6-Series is frontier intelligence, all the modalities, built in public. Xiaomi says Xiaomi MiMo-V2.5-Pro is a leap in agentic and long horizon coherence, Xiaomi MiMo-V2.5 is a leap in agency and multimodality, Xiaomi MiMo-V2-Pro has global top-tier agent capabilities, and Xiaomi MiMo-V2-Omni can see, hear, act in the agentic era. Xiaomi says Xiaomi MiMo-V2-Flash is blazing speed meets frontier performance."
        ],
