    "family_reading": {
        "text": "Xiaomi MiMo is a five version line, first released 2026-04-22 and newest on 2026-09-21. All five versions support reasoning, and four of the five publish open weights, so open weights are the norm rather than the exception. Context windows run from 1048576 to 1050000 tokens, and every listed version caps output at 131072 tokens. Input can be audio, image, text or video, and output is text only. Price varies widely: the Flash and V2.5 tiers sit at $0.14 input and $0.28 output per million tokens, the Pro tiers at $0.44 and $0.87, and MiMo-V2.6-Pro-UltraSpeed at $4.35 and $8.7. The family suits long document, audio and video work where reasoning matters, with cheap open weight options for most jobs. The UltraSpeed tier is the costly outlier, and the API only version cannot be self hosted.",
